{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>To do labor.</b> Scripture changes from what is said regarding the service of the sons of Gershon and the sons of Merari — ״to serve service״ — and says <b>to do labor</b>. By this it alerts us that the category of the service of the sons of Kehath is not called עבודה, because the Ark, on the contrary, carries its carriers (Numbers Rabbah ch. 4), and one does nothing with it except מלאכה. Further, it appears that since they must arrange a proper order in their carrying — when they carry on the shoulder and direct their walking toward the honor of the Ark of Elohim, like one who carries his master on his shoulder — therefore their service is called מלאכה, unlike the service of the sons of Gershon and the sons of Merari."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:05:59.999975090Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}